  "gamePromptDreams": "Dreams",
  "gamePromptGratitudeList": "What small thing made you smile today?|Who would you like to thank today, and why?|What simple thing are you grateful for this week?|What was the best thing you ate today?|Whose presence made your day lighter?|What did your body let you do today that deserves thanks?|What unexpected thing turned out to be nice today?|Which object around you quietly makes your life easier?|What small kindness did you receive recently?|Which place makes you feel calm, and why are you thankful for it?|What went better than expected this morning?|Which teacher or friend's lesson still stays with you?|Which old memory still warms you up?|What problem once felt heavy but is behind you now?|What do you have now that used to be only a wish?|Which sound, smell, or view did you enjoy most today?|What opportunity came your way this week that you appreciate?|Which small comfort do you forget about, like clean water or a soft bed?|Who supports you quietly without being asked?|What did your last mistake teach you that you can be thankful for?|Which part of your routine do you actually like?|What was the last kind word you heard?|What made you feel like you had enough today?|If you wrote a thank-you letter to yourself, what would it say?",
  "gamePromptReflectionList": "What did you learn today?|If you could redo today, what would you do differently?|What drained your energy the most this week?|What is one thing you want to let go of?|When did you last feel completely like yourself?|Which decision are you putting off, and what holds you back?|What have you been avoiding lately, and why?|What do you do only out of habit, not because you want to?|What do you actually need right now, rather than just want?|Which word best describes this week, and why?|Which small habit affects your mood the most?|When did you feel most energized today?|Which conversation is still on your mind?|What do you regret, and what can you do about it?|What boundary do you need to set with others or yourself?|What are you proud of this month, however small?|Which task has felt most meaningful lately?|What are you worried about, and how likely is it really?|If you advised yourself a year ago, what would you say?|What is making you rush, and is it necessary?|Who do you need to call or apologize to?|What do you want to do less of starting tomorrow?|What pattern do you notice when your money runs out quickly?|What is one small step you can take this week?",
  "gamePromptRelaxList": "If today were a song, what would its title be?|Tell about one funny conversation today.|If tomorrow were a day off, where would you go?|What made you laugh most recently?|If today were a movie, what genre and title would it be?|Which snack would go best with today?|If you had one free hour with no interruptions, what would you do?|Which animal best matches your mood right now?|What color suits your day, and why?|Who would you have lunch with if you could pick anyone?|What quirky habit of yours do you secretly like?|Which song have you been replaying lately?|If you had a tiny but useful superpower, what would it be?|What is your favorite snack spot, and what do you usually order?|Tell about the most absurd thing you saw this week.|If Nyaw could spend the whole day with you, what would you two do?|What is the coziest thing to do when it rains?|If your life had a soundtrack, what would the opening song be?|What show or book do you want to finish?|If you opened a tiny shop, what would you sell?|If today had no budget but you could buy only one thing, what would it be?|Which childhood game do you miss most?|If you could sleep in tomorrow, what would you hope to dream?|What makes a weekend feel like a weekend to you?",
  "gamePromptDreamsList": "What is one thing you want to achieve this month?|If money were no issue, what would you buy first?|Who do you want to be in five years?|What good habit do you want to start?|Which skill do you want to master this year?|Which city or country do you want to visit, and why?|What does a perfect day look like to you, from waking up to sleeping?|What do you want to save for, and how long are you willing to wait?|If you could change one thing in your life right now, what would it be?|What kind of home do you dream of?|Which small project do you want to start before the year ends?|Who do you want to meet or reconnect with?|What do you want to teach others someday?|If failing were impossible, what would you try?|Which experience do you want to have once in your life?|What do you want to remember about this year?|Which book do you want to read or write?|Describe your ideal job in one sentence.|Which fear do you want to overcome?|Which bad habit do you want to replace with a better one?|What is your nearest financial goal?|What do you want to do with family or friends this year?|What would you like to tell yourself five years from now?|Which old dream do you still want to bring back to life?",
